#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:3 9e7d0e58a1984a2a97d8ecbcd1a26c1b
msgid ""
"ARCHIVED: See :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page` for info for firmware "
"versions 4.1 and later"
msgstr "已归档：固件版本 4.1 及更高版本的信息请参见 :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page`"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:7 600e61b850354f74b35eed1c85cae5eb
msgid "Geo-Fencing in Plane"
msgstr "Plane 的地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:9 4303014645f349a49ceb384f861ecc3f
msgid ""
"The Geo-Fencing support in Plane firmware versions prior to 4.1, allows you "
"to set a virtual 'fence' around the area you want to fly in, specified as an"
" enclosed polygon of GPS positions plus a minimum and maximum altitude. For "
"firmware versions 4.1 and later, Plane uses the either a home centered "
"Cylindrical Fence, see :ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence` and/or "
"Inclusion/Exclusion Fences, see :ref:`common-polygon_fence`."
msgstr ""
"4.1 版本之前的 Plane 固件中的地理围栏支持，允许设置飞行区域周围的虚拟「围栏」，以 GPS "
"位置围成的封闭多边形加上最小和最大高度的形式指定。对于 4.1 及更高版本的固件，Plane 使用以 Home 为中心的柱形围栏（见 "
":ref:`common-ac2_simple_geofence`）和/或包含/排除围栏（见 :ref:`common-polygon_fence`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:14 8af3792248924553a6b6ae2c005c0a8d
msgid ""
"In Plane you MUST have the fence polygon drawn for the geofence parameters "
"to work.  In Copter you can specify a maximum fence altitude without the "
"fence polygon and Copter will adhere to it but Plane requires you to draw "
"the polygon for any of the fence parameters including the max/min ALT to "
"work."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 中，必须绘制围栏多边形，地理围栏参数才能生效。在 Copter 中，可以不绘制围栏多边形而仅指定最大围栏高度，Copter "
"会遵守该限制；但在 Plane 中，包括最大/最小高度在内的任何围栏参数都需要绘制多边形才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:20 60910496802d4667be4eaa3d1330d72b
msgid ""
"When fencing is enabled, if your plane goes outside the fenced area then it "
"will switch to GUIDED mode, and will fly back to a pre-defined return point,"
" and loiter there ready for you to take over again. You then use a switch on"
" your transmitter or use commands in your Ground Control Station (GCS) to "
"take back control."
msgstr ""
"启用围栏后，若飞机飞出围栏区域，将切换到 GUIDED "
"模式，飞回预定义的返回点并在此盘旋等待您重新接管。然后通过遥控器开关或地面站（GCS）命令重新获得控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:30 e534ac6499524c1dafe0281d0f513ff9
msgid "Use for R/C training"
msgstr "用于遥控训练"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:32 f4d2f24efcf2407c83eee814e016f5da
msgid ""
"One of the main uses of geo-fencing is to teach yourself (or someone else) "
"to fly radio controlled planes. When you have a properly configured geo-"
"fence it is very hard to crash, and you can try manoeuvres that would "
"normally be too likely to end in a crash, trusting the APM to 'bounce' the "
"plane off the geo-fence before the flight ends in disaster."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏的主要用途之一是自学（或教授他人）飞行遥控飞机。配置正确的地理围栏后，坠机变得非常困难，可以尝试通常风险过高的机动动作，因为 APM "
"会在飞机撞向地理围栏边界前将其「弹回」，避免灾难性结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:39 0236dd9feaac483f83c504ae02a96a5c
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing can be combined with any flight mode. So for a raw beginner, you"
" would combine it with one of the stabilised flight modes (such as STABILIZE"
" or FBWA). Once the pilot has gained some confidence you could combine it "
"with MANUAL mode, which gives direct control of the plane and allows for the"
" most interesting aerobatic manoeuvres. When used in this way the autopilot "
"stays out of your way completely, just passing the controls to the servos "
"directly, and only takes control if you go outside the fenced area or "
"outside the defined altitude range."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏可与任何飞行模式结合使用。对于初学者，可结合稳定飞行模式（如 Stabilize 或 FBWA）使用。待飞手积累一定信心后，可结合 MANUAL"
" "
"模式使用，该模式直接控制飞机，允许最有趣的特技机动。以此方式使用时，飞控完全不干预飞行，直接将控制信号传递给舵机，仅在飞出围栏区域或超出定义的高度范围时才接管控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:49 d46a80ca05954fbd9880b3630eb210f7
msgid "Use for containment"
msgstr "用于区域限制"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:51 9d5a89147755469d8da41e30611fffb8
msgid ""
"During fully autonomous operation the fence can be used as a failsafe "
"measure to ensure the aircraft stays within the intended flight area. During"
" fully autonomous operation use the "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` parameter and the plane will "
"automatically engage the fence after takeoff is complete and automatically "
"disable the fence when it arrives at a landing waypoint.  Set the "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` parameter to 1 to use this "
"feature.  For details on setting up landing and takeoff waypoints see the "
":ref:`Planning a Mission with Waypoints and Events <common-planning-a-"
"mission-with-waypoints-and-events>` page."
msgstr ""
"在全自主飞行期间，围栏可用作失控保护措施，确保飞机保持在预定飞行区域内。全自主飞行时，使用 "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` "
"参数，飞机将在起飞完成后自动启用围栏，并在到达降落航点时自动禁用围栏。将 "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` 设为 1 即可使用此功能。有关设置降落和起飞航点的详情，请参阅 "
":ref:`使用航点和事件规划任务 <common-planning-a-mission-with-waypoints-and-events>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:61 3bf1633fd7c444bfac0009c50547d4a0
msgid ""
"Of course, the fence can be used for containment in semi-autonomous missions"
" as well (missions where, e.g., takeoff and/or landing are manual) -- the "
"fence would still be enabled/disabled via the R/C transmitter or the GCS in "
"that case -- :ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` is optional."
msgstr ""
"当然，围栏也可用于半自主任务（如起飞和/或降落为手动操作）中的区域限制——在这种情况下，围栏仍需通过遥控器或 GCS "
"手动启用/禁用，:ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` 为可选。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:67 9e1c323a064648c6a35ae240381f71fa
msgid "Setting up geo-fencing"
msgstr "设置地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:69 e58e9bb41af84ab2a48a16777ee4d9cf
msgid "To setup geo-fencing in Plane you need to configure several things:"
msgstr "在 Plane 中设置地理围栏，需要配置以下几项："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:71 c5f7722b32184fbabeb0d72384e331f5
msgid "the boundary of the fence, as a set of GPS points"
msgstr "围栏边界，以 GPS 坐标点集合的形式"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:72 def33393678f49649f3d993816cea475
msgid "the action to take on fence breach"
msgstr "围栏被突破时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:73 68eefcd912c847679dbb0cd7f6cf4c30
msgid ""
"the location of the return point; note that optionally you may use the "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` parameter to have the plane return "
"to the closest :ref:`Rally Point <common-rally-points>` instead of the fence"
" return point."
msgstr ""
"返回点的位置；注意，可选择使用 :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 参数，使飞机返回最近的 "
":ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 而非围栏返回点。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:77 6e4b870e2fc244a58463f299ae0badc6
msgid "the minimum and maximum altitude of the fenced area"
msgstr "围栏区域的最小和最大高度"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:78 f49652f355e7493ca4fd41ee1ce78322
msgid ""
"what RC channel on your transmitter you will use to enable geo-fencing (if "
"any)"
msgstr "遥控器上用于启用地理围栏的 RC 通道（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:80 181563de95c74a77acadbd2d5538af74
msgid ""
"an optional setting (:ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>`) when you "
"want to configure the fence to automatically enable after an autonomous "
"takeoff and automatically disable after an autonomous landing"
msgstr ""
"可选设置（:ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>`），用于配置围栏在自主起飞后自动启用、在自主降落后自动禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:83 2bb4320221ec47d8bc7164861f2ac14a
msgid "how you want to take back control after a fence breach"
msgstr "围栏被突破后如何重新获得控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:85 d9ec534ba0fd497e9f35ac4af2bf5ab8
msgid "These can all be setup using Mission Planner."
msgstr "以上内容均可通过 Mission Planner 进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:87 892c583c417945888e3cc771523f6e85
msgid ""
"There are a few rules that you must follow when setting up your fence "
"boundary:"
msgstr "设置围栏边界时需遵守以下几条规则："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:90 fbe8e360ed8d421bbac8141ee348a32b
msgid "the return point must be inside the fence boundary"
msgstr "返回点必须位于围栏边界内"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:91 f0adff9674534f7992186e9b11d905cd
msgid ""
"the fence boundary must be fully enclosed. This means it must have at least "
"4 points, and the last point must be the same as the first point"
msgstr "围栏边界必须完全封闭，即至少需要 4 个点，且最后一个点必须与第一个点相同"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:94 9863ceb7729a4f0590ee71e28d2aaa54
msgid "the boundary can have at most 18 points"
msgstr "边界最多可有 18 个点"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:96 842b9dc284ec4fdb8b896d6bc8faa579
msgid ""
"If you setup your fence with the APM planner it should ensure you follow "
"these rules."
msgstr "若使用 APM planner 设置围栏，应能确保遵守这些规则。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:99 7885cd2c75614054bdcd6e1ca0d7915b
msgid ""
"Please remember when making your fence boundary that your plane will have "
"some momentum when it hits the fence, and will take time to turn back to the"
" return point. For a plane like the SkyWalker we recommend an additional "
"safety margin of around 30 meters inside the true boundary of where you want"
" to fly. The same goes for the minimum altitude - you need to make it high "
"enough that the APM has time to recover from a fast dive. How much margin "
"you need depends on the flight characteristics of your plane."
msgstr ""
"设置围栏边界时请记住，飞机到达围栏时仍有一定动量，需要一定时间转向返回点。对于 SkyWalker 类飞机，建议在真实边界内侧额外保留约 30 "
"米的安全余量。最低高度同理——需设置得足够高，使 APM 有时间从快速俯冲中恢复。所需余量取决于您飞机的飞行特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:108 76d13db2dd604934bbe3f187310ffac2
msgid ""
"Apart from the fence boundary, the following MAVLink parameters control geo-"
"fencing behaviour:"
msgstr "除围栏边界外，以下 MAVLink 参数控制地理围栏行为："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:111 2ad8bbe8d1864c66baff11257ae5cae1
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` - the action to take on fence breach. This"
" defaults to zero which disables geo-fencing. Set it to 1 to enable geo-"
"fencing and fly to the return point on fence breach.  Set to 2 to report a "
"breach to the GCS but take no other action.  Set to 3 to have the plane head"
" to the return point on breach, but the pilot will maintain manual throttle "
"control in this case."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` - 围栏被突破时采取的动作。默认值为 0，禁用地理围栏。设为 1 "
"表示启用地理围栏，突破时飞往返回点；设为 2 表示向 GCS 报告突破但不采取其他动作；设为 3 表示突破时飞往返回点，但飞手保留手动油门控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:117 ad92a115168648be89d18b4f556462b6
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` - the minimum altitude in meters. If "
"this is zero then you will not have a minimum altitude."
msgstr ":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` - 最低高度（米）。若为 0 则无最低高度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:119 72cc1e8873674f0880cfeafe4daaa2ec
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` - the maximum altitude in meters. If "
"this is zero then you will not have a maximum altitude."
msgstr ":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` - 最高高度（米）。若为 0 则无最高高度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:121 896a254f888e40738cf89130773426ea
msgid ""
"``FENCE_CHANNEL<FENCE_CHANNEL>`` (revs previous to 4.1), ``RCx_OPTION`` = 11"
" - the RC input channel to watch for enabling the geo-fence. This defaults "
"to zero, which disables geo-fencing. You should set it to a spare RC input "
"channel that is connected to a two position switch on your transmitter. "
"Fencing will be enabled when this channel goes above a PWM value of 1750. If"
" your transmitter supports it it is also a good idea to enable audible "
"feedback when this channel is enabled (a beep every few seconds), so you can"
" tell if the fencing is enabled without looking down."
msgstr ""
"``FENCE_CHANNEL<FENCE_CHANNEL>`` （4.1 之前版本），``RCx_OPTION`` = 11 - "
"监视是否启用地理围栏的 RC 输入通道。默认值为 0，禁用地理围栏。应将其设置为连接到遥控器两档开关的备用 RC 输入通道。当此通道 PWM 值超过 "
"1750 时，围栏将被启用。若遥控器支持，建议在启用此通道时加入声音反馈（每隔几秒一声蜂鸣），以便不必低头查看即可判断围栏是否已启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:129 bb1d6211af254a91b1951ab021c83142
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_TOTAL<FENCE_TOTAL>` - the number of points in your fence (the "
"return point plus the enclosed boundary). This should be set for you by the "
"planner when you create the fence."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FENCE_TOTAL<FENCE_TOTAL>` - 围栏中的点数（返回点加上封闭边界的点）。创建围栏时应由规划软件自动设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:132 ffbe2aaafab3491fb89bbd91ef46d16b
msgid ""
"``FENCE_RETALT`` - the altitude the aircraft will fly at when flying to the "
"return point and when loitering at the return point (in meters). Note that "
"when :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is set to 1 this parameter is "
"ignored and the loiter altitude of the closest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` is used instead.  If this parameter is zero and "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is also zero, the midpoint of the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX <FENCE_ALT_MAX>` and :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN "
"<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` parameters is used as the return altitude."
msgstr ""
"``FENCE_RETALT`` - 飞机飞向返航点以及在返航点盘旋时的飞行高度（米）。注意，当 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 设为 1 时此参数被忽略，改用最近的 :ref:`集结点 "
"<common-rally-points>` 的盘旋高度。如果此参数为零且 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 也为零，则使用 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX "
"<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` 和 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN <FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 参数的中点作为返航高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:139 57637317779e461b9a2750d3dbd432ff
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` - if set to 1, the aircraft will "
"boot with the fence disabled.  After an autonomous takeoff completes the "
"fences will automatically enable.  When the autonomous mission arrives at a "
"landing waypoint the fence automatically disables."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` - 若设为 "
"1，飞机启动时围栏禁用。自主起飞完成后围栏自动启用；当自主任务到达降落航点时围栏自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:143 3706514d29294d39b1ce392456182392
msgid ""
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` - if set to 1 the aircraft will head"
" to the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-rally-points>` rather than the "
"fence return point when the fence is breached. Note that the loiter altitude"
" of the Rally Point is used as the return altitude."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` - 若设为 1，围栏被突破时飞机将飞向最近的 :ref:`集结点 "
"<common-rally-points>` 而非围栏返回点。注意：集结点的盘旋高度将作为返回高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:151 c648a4529042484790d6b3467ec68e5e
msgid ""
"A Rally Point can be outside of the geofence but this is NOT recommended.  "
"If you have a rally point outside the geofence you will need to disable the "
"geofence using ``FENCE_CHANNEL`` before you can control the plane again "
"otherwise the plane will stay in GUIDED mode FOREVER circling the rally "
"point.  Once the geofence is disabled you should fly the plane back inside "
"the geofence and then re-enable it."
msgstr ""
"集结点可以位于地理围栏外，但不推荐这样做。若集结点在围栏外，需在重新控制飞机之前使用 ``FENCE_CHANNEL`` "
"禁用地理围栏，否则飞机将永远处于 GUIDED 模式绕集结点盘旋。禁用地理围栏后，应将飞机飞回围栏内再重新启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:159 6a8bb68f492d4a98bea6a29a2f20dbf3
msgid ""
"One additional parameter may be useful to get the most out of geo-fencing. "
"When you breach the fence, the plane will switch to GUIDED mode and fly back"
" to the return point (or the nearest Rally Point, if "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` has been set to 1). Once you are "
"back inside the fence boundary you are able to take control again, and you "
"need to tell the APM that you want to take control. You can do that in one "
"of 3 ways:"
msgstr ""
"还有一个额外参数可能有助于充分利用地理围栏。突破围栏后，飞机将切换到 GUIDED 模式并飞回返回点（若 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 设为 1 则飞往最近集结点）。回到围栏边界内后即可重新接管控制，需要告知"
" APM 您想要接管。可通过以下 3 种方式之一实现："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:166 e5a57cef8f9245f58b0dd91b850ee332
msgid ""
"changing modes using the mode switch on your transmitter, or changing modes "
"via the Mission Planner GCS (e.g., change from GUIDED mode to AUTO mode)."
msgstr "使用遥控器模式开关切换模式，或通过 Mission Planner GCS 切换模式（例如从 GUIDED 模式切换到 AUTO 模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:169 7fc3e6594dbc416c8f30cfcfe5b6f420
msgid ""
"disabling and re-enabling geo-fencing using the rc channel setup for fence "
"control above."
msgstr "使用上述为围栏控制设置的 RC 通道禁用后重新启用地理围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:171 c32b7541a7d6489eaabfe75e4fbe5e70
msgid ""
"set the ``RST_SWITCH_CH`` MAVLink parameter to another two-position channel "
"that is attached to a spring loaded switch. The ``RST_SWITCH`` parameter "
"defaults to zero which disables it. If you set it to a channel then you can "
"use this channel switch to take back control after a fence breach."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RST_SWITCH_CH`` MAVLink 参数设置为另一个连接弹簧复位开关的两档通道。``RST_SWITCH`` 参数默认为 "
"0，表示禁用。设置通道后，可在围栏突破后使用此通道开关重新获得控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:177 cff890fbfd9f47bb8fea4587f38b3102
msgid ""
"If not flying completely autonomously, I find that using ``RST_SWITCH_CH`` "
"is the best option for geo-fencing as it means that the APM has fencing "
"enabled throughout the flight, and you don't get any behaviour change by "
"switching modes. It does take up another channel though, so some people may "
"not have enough channels to use it."
msgstr ""
"在非完全自主飞行时，我发现使用 ``RST_SWITCH_CH`` 是地理围栏最佳选项，因为这意味着 APM "
"在整个飞行过程中始终启用围栏，切换模式也不会产生任何行为变化。但这会占用一个通道，因此有些用户可能没有足够的通道来使用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:184 4911a6446d7c44eca1f1564b14e59f90
msgid "Setting up the fence boundary"
msgstr "设置围栏边界"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:187 50b266a820384c3a96bea55437679e60
msgid "APMPlanner"
msgstr "APMPlanner"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:189 68788ab123224dffb890b9f8cb99662a
msgid ""
"To setup a fence boundary you should use the 'Flight Planner' screen in the "
"APM Planner."
msgstr "设置围栏边界应使用 APM Planner 中的「飞行规划」界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:192 99fd0936dd4b48a48f1e8c0abb0fedd6
msgid ""
"Start by right-clicking the location you want for the return point and "
"choosing 'Set return location'. The return point should be somewhere in the "
"middle of your flight area, and in easy visual range of where you will be "
"standing when you fly."
msgstr "首先在想要设置返回点的位置右键点击，选择「设置返回位置」。返回点应位于飞行区域中间某处，且在您飞行时站立位置的明显视距范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:197 5604eeaa8d5743f8b9b82dce8ec55c40
msgid ""
"After you've set the return point you should right click on the first point "
"on the boundary of the fence you want. Choose 'Draw Polygon ->"
msgstr "设置返回点后，在围栏边界的第一个点上右键点击，选择「绘制多边形 ->"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:200 96362d16758247709dd57ca30e47d2f8
msgid ""
"Add polygon point'. You are then in polygon mode, and you should left-click "
"to add each point in the boundary of your fence. The planner will "
"automatically complete the polygon by connecting the last point to the first"
" one."
msgstr "添加多边形点」。进入多边形模式后，左键单击依次添加围栏边界的各点，规划软件将自动连接最后一个点与第一个点以封闭多边形。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:205 a529e4144d89473eba5e383828547b6e
msgid ""
"You can then right-click and choose geo-fencing upload to send your fence "
"boundary to the APM. The planner will ask you for the minimum and maximum "
"altitude (in meters) of your fence before uploading. You can also save your "
"fence to a file for later loading."
msgstr ""
"然后右键点击，选择地理围栏上传，将围栏边界发送到 APM。上传前规划软件会询问围栏的最小和最大高度（米）。也可将围栏保存到文件以便后续加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:211 9b78bea303a44c4eb363f568ec1efd50
msgid "Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:213 c24714e7429d46a898f2e4bcd9745c5a
msgid ""
"Mission Planner follows a very similar process.  Start by right-clicking "
"where you want to begin the geo-fence boundary."
msgstr "Mission Planner 采用非常相似的流程。首先在想要开始地理围栏边界的位置右键点击。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:219 f5fc5967eec04773bb4d75b639dec3c8
msgid "Add Polygon Point"
msgstr "添加多边形点"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:221 e89e752c784441d3a1eb5bc55e1d255f
msgid ""
"Continue to click on the map where you want the geo-fence boundary and the "
"polygon will appear.  You can drag any points you want to adjust. Then right"
" click on the map where you want the plane to return to when a geo-fence "
"breach occurs."
msgstr "继续在地图上点击想要地理围栏边界的位置，多边形将逐步显示。可拖动任意点进行调整。然后在地图上地理围栏被突破时飞机应返回的位置右键点击。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:229 f6101d892bef4a09ac0ab6bdef58d298
msgid "Geo-Fence Set ReturnLocation"
msgstr "地理围栏设置返回位置"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:231 99351b92efe44f398a5aee401623c4b5
msgid "Finally upload the geo-fence."
msgstr "最后上传地理围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:236 c22cc86c57c4482486f371ba03442b62
msgid "Geo-Fence Upload"
msgstr "地理围栏上传"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:239 1bee299336f643bc9f059f7a32a6e27f
msgid "Altitude of the return point"
msgstr "返回点的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:241 1aff6bd7b32847a5bab1d96a606f3d4a
msgid ""
"If you set the :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` parameter to 1, then "
"the return altitude will be **the same as the loiter altitude of the nearest"
" Rally Point**.  If the :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is set to 0,"
" then you may set the return altitude in meters above the Home Point with "
"the ``FENCE_RETALT`` parameter.  **Otherwise**:"
msgstr ""
"若将 :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 参数设为 1，返回高度将与 **最近集结点的盘旋高度相同**。若 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` 设为 0，可通过 ``FENCE_RETALT`` 参数以 Home "
"点以上高度（米）设置返回高度。**否则**："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:247 97d177ea3378456db5e2038067d1a045
msgid ""
"If you set ``FENCE_MINALT`` and ``FENCE_MAXALT`` to other than zero (and "
"have ``FENCE_MAXALT`` greater than FENCE_MINALT) then the return point "
"altitude will be half way between ``FENCE_MINALT`` and ``FENCE_MAXALT``."
msgstr ""
"若将 ``FENCE_MINALT`` 和 ``FENCE_MAXALT`` 设为非零值（且 ``FENCE_MAXALT`` 大于 "
"FENCE_MINALT），返回点高度将为 ``FENCE_MINALT`` 和 ``FENCE_MAXALT`` 的中点。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:251 1810292bed1041ddb56341c6a77f3918
msgid ""
"If you don't setup ``FENCE_MINALT`` and ``FENCE_MAXALT`` (ie. leave them at "
"zero) then the return point altitude will be given by the "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` parameter, which is also used for RTL "
"mode. Note that :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` is in centimetres, whereas"
" ``FENCE_MINALT`` and ``FENCE_MAXALT`` are in meters."
msgstr ""
"若未设置 ``FENCE_MINALT`` 和 ``FENCE_MAXALT`` （即保留为 0），返回点高度将由 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 参数给出，该参数也用于 RTL 模式。注意 "
":ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 的单位为厘米，而 ``FENCE_MINALT`` 和 "
"``FENCE_MAXALT`` 的单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:256 605716ae7733493b9bae9e87ffa5dfe7
msgid ""
"If your flying club and local flying rules don't set a maximum altitude then"
" we recommend you use a maximum altitude of at most 122 meters (which is "
"around 400 feet). Beyond that altitude it becomes quite difficult to keep "
"good eye contact with your model."
msgstr ""
"若飞行俱乐部和当地飞行规则未设定最高高度限制，建议最高高度不超过 122 米（约 400 英尺）。超过该高度时，与模型保持良好目视接触将变得相当困难。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:261 041e67ca5aba4e669eaf07d576501fdd
msgid ""
"With ``FENCE_MINALT`` set at 30 meters (to allow for some dive momentum) and"
" ``FENCE_MAXALT`` set to 122 meters, the return point will be 76 meters, "
"which is quite a good altitude to leave the plane loitering while you are "
"getting ready to have another go."
msgstr ""
"将 ``FENCE_MINALT`` 设为 30 米（以允许一定的俯冲动量余量），``FENCE_MAXALT`` 设为 122 米，则返回点高度为 "
"76 米，这是一个相当好的高度，可让飞机在盘旋等待下一次飞行时保持安全高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:267 c467b2a5cbc0499db88bfc46c9ab2633
msgid "Stick-mixing on fence breach"
msgstr "围栏突破时的摇杆混控"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:269 57be85e63df542be92f7b13a072f905b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot enables 'stick mixing' by default when in auto modes. This means "
"that you can change the path of a loiter, for example, by using your "
"transmitter sticks."
msgstr "ArduPilot 在自动模式下默认启用「杆量混合」。这意味着你可以通过使用遥控器摇杆来改变盘旋路径等。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:273 831f440ac30c4b55a859540065eeb9f4
msgid ""
"When you are using geo-fencing, stick mixing will be disabled on fence "
"breach until your plane is back inside the fenced region. This is to ensure "
"that the bad control inputs that caused you to breach the fence don't "
"prevent it from recovering to the return point."
msgstr "当你使用地理围栏时，突破围栏后将禁用杆量混合，直到飞机返回围栏区域内。这是为了确保导致你突破围栏的错误控制输入不会妨碍飞机恢复到返回点。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:278 6ddb6294a1a64b07b474df084ae76f5c
msgid ""
"As soon as you are back inside the fence stick mixing will be re-enabled, "
"allowing you to control the GUIDED mode that the plane will be in. If by "
"using stick mixing you manage to take the plane outside the fence again then"
" stick mixing will again be disabled until you are back inside the fence."
msgstr ""
"一旦你返回围栏内，杆量混合将重新启用，允许你控制飞机将处于的 Guided "
"模式。如果通过杆量混合再次将飞机带出围栏，则杆量混合将再次被禁用，直到你重新回到围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:285 a51255e27a42410f8efc7048a3c61d96
msgid "Tips for flying with geo-fencing"
msgstr "地理围栏飞行技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:287 9e578a4800994a449df2ca3dac129011
msgid ""
"You should have geo-fencing disabled when on the ground and for takeoff. Be "
"careful not to enable it on the ground, as it may declare a fence breach and"
" try to fly to the return point.  If flying fully autonomously you may use "
"the :ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` parameter to assist with this "
"complication."
msgstr ""
"在地面及起飞时应禁用地理围栏。注意不要在地面启用围栏，否则可能触发围栏突破并尝试飞往返回点。若进行全自主飞行，可使用 "
":ref:`FENCE_AUTOENABLE<FENCE_AUTOENABLE>` 参数协助处理此情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:293 9f0ede9e74464bb1af1fbba08f67b674
msgid ""
"Also remember to disable it for landing, as the altitude breach when you are"
" coming in will make it very hard to land!"
msgstr "同样记得在降落前禁用围栏，否则降落时的高度突破将使降落变得非常困难！"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:296 47ac4bdaff4c433e817c164bf740cf92
msgid ""
"If you are using an APM1 and want to combine geo-fencing with MANUAL mode, "
"then remember that on the APM1 the APM software is bypassed when using "
"channel 8 for mode switching and a switch PWM channel value above 1750 (this"
" is called 'hardware manual' on the APM1). So you either need to set a "
"different switch position as MANUAL, or use a different mode switch control "
"channel (and set :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` to the channel you are "
"using)."
msgstr ""
"若使用 APM1 并希望将地理围栏与 MANUAL 模式结合使用，请记住在 APM1 上使用通道 8 进行模式切换且开关 PWM 值高于 1750 "
"时，APM 软件会被绕过（这在 APM1 上称为「硬件手动」）。因此需要将 MANUAL 模式设置在其他开关位置，或使用不同的模式切换控制通道（并将 "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` 设为您使用的通道）。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:304 580247413f224c3e9eefc78331fc678c
msgid ""
"Before you takeoff and fly with geo-fencing make sure all the parameters are"
" setup as described above, and also make sure you have a good GPS lock. If "
"you lose GPS lock then geo-fencing will disable itself until GPS lock is "
"regained, so don't use it if your GPS signal is marginal."
msgstr ""
"起飞并使用地理围栏飞行前，确认上述所有参数已正确设置，并确保有良好的 GPS 信号。若丢失 GPS 信号，地理围栏将自动禁用直至重新获得 GPS "
"锁定，因此信号不稳定时请勿使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:309 45215fc39c5d4519b2c14bcd79455966
msgid ""
"I'd also recommend you test it gently at first. Try slowly approaching a "
"fence boundary and ensure it correctly 'bounces' off the virtual wall and "
"returns to the return point OK. Then after taking control again, try slowly "
"approaching the minimum altitude and ensure it bounces off the "
"``FENCE_MINALT`` you have set."
msgstr ""
"建议先温和地测试。缓慢接近围栏边界，确认正确地从虚拟围墙「弹回」并正常返回返回点。重新获得控制权后，再缓慢接近最低高度，确认在 "
"``FENCE_MINALT`` 处正确弹回。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:315 1e831297f85648d9b091b344c6e4fcc3
msgid ""
"While developing geo-fencing I found that combining it with MANUAL mode is "
"the most fun. It gives you all of the excitement of manual flight with sharp"
" turns and fancy stunts while saving your plane when you make a mistake."
msgstr "在开发地理围栏时，我发现将其与 MANUAL 模式结合使用最为有趣。在急转弯和炫酷特技的手动飞行中，出错时仍能保住飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:321 5b616638b59d43d2916e9bef330a8e45
msgid "Example flight"
msgstr "飞行示例"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:323 ce3265ad821349e3bc939a345a29b05e
msgid ""
"This is the track from a flight with geo-fencing enabled at my local flying "
"club while flying my !SkyWalker. The white lines show the geo-fence "
"boundary, plus you can see the return point in the middle. You can also see "
"the points where the plane breached the geo-fence to the north, west and "
"south. There were also numerous altitude breaches, as I was using this "
"flight to try to improve my inverted flight skills in MANUAL mode. The plane"
" would not have survived without the geo-fence!"
msgstr ""
"这是在当地飞行俱乐部启用地理围栏飞行我的 !SkyWalker "
"时的飞行轨迹。白色线条显示地理围栏边界，可以看到中间的返回点，以及飞机在北、西、南方向突破地理围栏的点。还有多次高度突破，因为我用这次飞行来练习 "
"MANUAL 模式下的倒飞技巧，没有地理围栏飞机早就坠毁了！"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:334 b8d2926e5e334655b3df8185eaa2bdd5
msgid ""
"Notice that the geo-fence in this example runs along the middle of the "
"runway. This is to conform to my local club rules. The takeoff and landing "
"were done with the fence disabled. I had ``FENCE_CHANNEL`` set to 7, and "
"``RST_SWITCH_CH`` set to 6. That allowed me to enable the fence after "
"takeoff using one switch, then to take back control after a breach using the"
" spring loaded trainer switch."
msgstr ""
"注意此示例中地理围栏沿跑道中线延伸，这是为了符合当地俱乐部规则。起降时关闭了围栏。我将 ``FENCE_CHANNEL`` 设为 "
"7，``RST_SWITCH_CH`` 设为 6。这样可以用一个开关在起飞后启用围栏，然后用弹簧复位的教练开关在突破后重新获得控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:341 a5290a23c9834366808937f65ce004a4
msgid ""
"in firmware versions 4.1 and later, ``FENCE_CHANNEL`` is replaced by setting"
" a channel's ``RCx_OPTION`` to 208, and ``RST_SWITCH_CH`` is replaced by "
"setting a channel's ``RCx_OPTION`` to 96."
msgstr ""
"在固件版本 4.1 及更高版本中，``FENCE_CHANNEL`` 被设置某通道的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 为 208 "
"所取代，``RST_SWITCH_CH`` 被设置某通道的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 为 96 所取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:344 4359a5852db84036972f7b0ba3a31039
msgid "MAVLink support"
msgstr "MAVLink 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:346 9b84dab5259747d099367a5013c12b45
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will report the fence status via the MAVLink GCS protocol. The key"
" status packet is called FENCE_STATUS, and is defined in "
"\"ardupilotmega.xml\". A typical FENCE_STATUSpacket looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 MAVLink GCS 协议报告围栏状态。关键状态数据包称为 FENCE_STATUS，定义在 "
"「ardupilotmega.xml」中。典型的 FENCE_STATUS 数据包如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:354 326a50884c0749779d03ad09ad1a187f
msgid ""
"The breach_status field is 0 if inside the fence, and 1 if outside. The "
"breach_count is how many fence breaches you have had on this flight. The "
"breach_type is the type of the last breach (see the FENCE_BREACH enum in "
"ardupilotmega.xml). The breach_time is the time in milliseconds of the "
"breach since APM was booted."
msgstr ""
"breach_status 字段在围栏内时为 0，在围栏外时为 1。breach_count 是本次飞行中围栏突破的次数。breach_type "
"是最近一次突破的类型（见 ardupilotmega.xml 中的 FENCE_BREACH 枚举）。breach_time 是自 APM "
"启动以来突破发生的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:360 7de4d2d0dc6f4635ac6c19e547099ff6
msgid ""
"The MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE bit of the MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR portion of the "
"SYS_STATUS message indicates whether or not the geo-fence is breached.  As "
"of this writing only the MAVProxy GCS recognizes this status bit and reports"
" the status of the geo-fence.  In the future the Mission Planner, APM "
"Planner, and other GCS applications should get support for announcing geo-"
"fence status during the flight."
msgstr ""
"SYS_STATUS 消息的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR 部分中的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE "
"位指示地理围栏是否被突破。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy GCS 识别此状态位并报告地理围栏状态。未来 Mission Planner、APM "
"Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序应获得在飞行期间宣布地理围栏状态的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:367 1ae564c381f14af890cb26e34993a4e9
msgid ""
"The MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink command message allows a GCS to enable "
"or disable a fence interactively.  As of this writing only MAVProxy supports"
" this message using the \"fence enable\" or \"fence disable\" commands.  In "
"the future Mission Planner, APM Planner, and other GCS applications should "
"get support for interactively enabling and disabling the geo-fence without "
"needing to use a manual transmitter."
msgstr ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink 命令消息允许 GCS 交互式地启用或禁用围栏。截至本文写作时，只有 MAVProxy "
"支持此消息，使用「fence enable」或「fence disable」命令。未来 Mission Planner、APM Planner 及其他 "
"GCS 应用程序应获得无需使用手动遥控器即可交互式启用和禁用地理围栏的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:375 09897bdcef264a4f800480d51ca0c46d
msgid "Advanced Features"
msgstr "高级功能"

#: ../../source/docs/geofencing.rst:377 d37beffa46c744c5bd0823ba21080936
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing in Plane can also be used as part of a failsafe system, for "
"competitions like the Outback Challenge. For those type of events you should"
" define your fence boundary as usual, but additionally build APM with the "
"FENCE_TRIGGERED_PIN option set in **APM_Config.h**. This option allows you "
"to set a digital pin on your APM to go high when the fence is breached. You "
"can connect this pin to your planes failsafe device to trigger the planes "
"failsafe mode (which for the OBC competition involves setting extreme servo "
"values to dive the plane into the ground)."
msgstr ""
"Plane 中的地理围栏也可作为失控保护系统的一部分使用，例如在 Outback Challenge 等比赛中。对于此类赛事，应按常规定义围栏边界，并在"
" **APM_Config.h** 中设置 FENCE_TRIGGERED_PIN 选项来编译 APM。此选项允许在围栏突破时将 APM "
"上的数字引脚拉高，可将此引脚连接到飞机的失控保护装置，以触发飞机的失控保护模式（对于 OBC 比赛，涉及设置极端舵机值以使飞机俯冲入地）。"
